  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Civic and Voter Education</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="PT">Educa&#xe7;&#xe3;o C&#xed;vica e Eleitoral</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="PT">A actividade centrar-se-&#xe1; na concep&#xe7;&#xe3;o e implementa&#xe7;&#xe3;o de programas de educa&#xe7;&#xe3;o c&#xed;vica e eleitoral que adiram &#xe0;s medidas covid-19. isto inclui garantir que a forma&#xe7;&#xe3;o patrocinada pela USAID ser&#xe1; realizada num ambiente onde a dist&#xe2;ncia f&#xed;sica &#xe9; estritamente observada, o uso de m&#xe1;scaras e o uso de higieniza&#xe7;&#xe3;o das m&#xe3;os s&#xe3;o aplicados. A publica&#xe7;&#xe3;o e os materiais educativos em v&#xed;deo para os eleitores tamb&#xe9;m incluir&#xe3;o mensagens de conscientiza&#xe7;&#xe3;o ao p&#xfa;blico sobre como seguir o protocolo da covid-19, inclusive quando eles forem votar no dia das elei&#xe7;&#xf5;es.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The activity will focus on design and implement civic and voter education programs which adhere to covid-19 measures. this includes ensuring that usaid-sponsored training will be conducted in the environment where physical distance is strictly observed, masks wearing and the use of hand-sanitation is enforced. publication and video voter education materials will also include awareness raising messages to the public on how to follow covid-19 protocol including when they come to vote on the election day.</narrative>
  </description>
